   *   - Use row pointers (Ai, Aj) to avoid repeated address arithmetic
   *     and to encourage unit-stride memory accesses.
   *   - Accumulate into local scalars (tmp, diag) so that the compiler
   *     can keep values in registers instead of repeatedly loading and
   *     storing A[i][j] / A[i][i].
   *   - Manually unroll the innermost loops to expose more ILP and help
   *     the auto-vectorizer.
